    "text": "KCRG.com\nwebsite\nWaterloo\nCause of death revealed for victim found in Waterloo house explosion\nBy KCRG Staff,\n6 hours agoWATERLOO, Iowa (KCRG) - A cause of death has been revealed for the singular victim found in the aftermath of a Waterloo house explosion in March. On March 26, crews in Waterloo responded to an explosion that happened at a home on the corner of Sager Avenue and Sheerer Avenue.",
